# Regenerable build artifacts — not worth versioning:
#   - vendor/: a plain npm-installed copy of gsap, re-fetchable with
#     `npm install gsap@3.14.2`
#   - music/, sfx/: copies of assets bundled with the /brag skill itself
#     (~/.claude/skills/brag/assets), re-copyable from there
#   - snapshots/: debug PNGs from `hyperframes snapshot`, not part of the
#     composition source
composition/assets/vendor/
composition/assets/music/
composition/assets/sfx/
composition/snapshots/
